[x] Pilot coordination with existing tools and measure reliance =coordination-pilot $Executed 2026-09-14, two runs (report knowledge/evaluations/coordination-pilot-report.md, commits a6454b9 + a46ebad). Run 1: changed-support PASSED, honest-impossibility PASSED, scope-expansion declined, reuse-without-rereading FAILED (reconstruction cheaper at 50-line scale), wrong-but-current claim undetected, both §1 trust limits reproduced, CC1 live. Run 2 (load-bearing probe): reliance arm DETECTED the planted false claim and superseded it, but declined to break the documented design rule against a direct instruction (both readings recorded); control arm implemented the fix overriding the rule. Sharpest gap unchanged: repo-wide orientation vs worktree truth -> workstreams-sessions; all else maps to none. Pending: coordination-selection disposition; platform submodule addendum optional.$ !2 ^2026-09-14T14:28 %2026-09-15T12:23 <contextual-freshness <collective-agency-protocol #01a0a1d2-318f-76a3-b3d7-4bb8ef380c63
